&lt;p&gt;Likely candidates for 0.6: a richer &lt;code&gt;Skeleton&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Breadcrumb&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Pagination&lt;/code&gt;, a &lt;code&gt;Menu&lt;/code&gt; built on the same Popover primitives, and a small &lt;code&gt;useMediaQuery&lt;/code&gt; exposing the design tokens' breakpoints.&lt;/p&gt;

